---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Upper Cafe — Bergen County Academies">
  <style>
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.8rem);
      font-weight: normal;
      line-height: 1.25;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    h1 em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: #8B6914;
    }

    .intro {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: #444;
      max-width: 520px;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .cta-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    }

    .cta-primary {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #1a1a1a;
      color: #FAFAF7;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.55rem 1.25rem;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 4px;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }
    .cta-primary:hover { background: #333; color: #FAFAF7; }

    .cta-secondary {
      display: inline-block;
      color: #555;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.55rem 1.25rem;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .cta-secondary:hover { border-color: #999; color: #1a1a1a; }

    hr {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #e0ddd5;
      margin: 2.5rem 0;
    }

    .section-label {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #999;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .scenario-block {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .scenario-block h3 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    }

    .scenario-block p {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #555;
      max-width: 480px;
    }

    .platform-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .platform-list li {
      padding: 0.85rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e5de;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .platform-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

    .platform-list .p-name {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .platform-list .p-name:hover { text-decoration: underline; color: #8B6914; }

    .platform-list .p-desc {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: #888;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      text-align: right;
      max-width: 280px;
    }
  </style>

  <h1>Study hall check-in for <em>BCA</em> students, finally done right.</h1>

  <p class="intro">
    Upper Cafe has always run on paper and a Google Doc that nobody can find.
    This fixes that — students check in on a laptop, admins see who's there in real time.
    No clipboards. No hunting through spreadsheets.
  </p>

  <div class="cta-row">
    <a href="https://app.bcaupper.cafe" class="cta-primary">Check In Now</a>
    <a href="https://app.bcaupper.cafe/absences" class="cta-secondary">View Today's Absences</a>
  </div>

  <hr />

  <p class="section-label">Two ways to end up in Upper Cafe</p>

  <div class="scenario-block">
    <h3>Your study hall is already scheduled there.</h3>
    <p>Walk in, open the web app, pick your period, type your name. Done. You're on the roster.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="scenario-block">
    <h3>Your class teacher is absent.</h3>
    <p>Select your period, find your teacher on the daily absence list, and check in. The admin desk updates live so the monitor knows exactly who's there and why.</p>
  </div>

  <hr />

  <p class="section-label">What's here</p>

  <ul class="platform-list">
    <li>
      <a href="https://app.bcaupper.cafe" class="p-name">Web App — app.bcaupper.cafe</a>
      <span class="p-desc">Student check-in, absence board, admin roster</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://github.com/bca-upper-cafe/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="p-name">GitHub — bca-upper-cafe</a>
      <span class="p-desc">All source code, open</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="p-name" style="cursor:default;">Mobile App — iOS & Android</span>
      <span class="p-desc">View absences on your phone — coming soon</span>
    </li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
